<title>UK: FORECAST - Consensus on UK company results.</title>
<headline>FORECAST - Consensus on UK company results.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-02-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>Analysts' estimates of UK company</p>
<p>results expected in week ending February 28 include -</p>
<p>COMPANY----------------PFT/DIV/EPS--CONSENSUS----RANGE-------PVS</p>
<p>MONDAY, February 24</p>
<p>NO MAJOR COMPANIES REPORTING</p>
<p>TUESDAY, February 25</p>
<p>National	   F	  *PFT	1168	  1090-1250   1753</p>
<p>Westminster		    DIV	29.0	  29.0-29.5   25.3</p>
<p>Guardian	   F	   PFT	280	   250-351     340</p>
<p>Royal			    DIV	10.0	  9.0-10.0    9.0</p>
<p>WEDNESDAY, February 26</p>
<p>Prudential	 F	   PFT	851	   751-880     804</p>
<p>				   DIV	17.0	  17.0-17.2   15.7</p>
<p>				   EPS	25.2	  29.0-31.4   39.8</p>
<p>Commercial	 F	   PFT	480	   435-588     509</p>
<p>Union			    DIV	30.3	  30.2-30.5  28.25</p>
<p>				   EPS	41.2	  41.0-41.4   52.1</p>
<p>British	    F	 **PFT	417	   410-425     234</p>
<p>Aerospace			DIV	15.6	  15.0-16.0   12.5</p>
<p>				   EPS	69.0	  67.4-71.3   48.8</p>
<p>THURSDAY, February 27</p>
<p>Lasmo		F	***PFT	70.2	  64-75	 34.0</p>
<p>				   DIV	1.25	  1.25-2.0    1.25</p>
<p> RTZ-CRA Plc     F     ****PFT	1009	  1006-1140   1440</p>
<p>FRIDAY, February 28</p>
<p>- no major companies reporting</p>
<p>	  * Includes exceptional losses.</p>
<p>	 ** Forecasts are for Pre tax profit after exceptionals.</p>
<p>	    Before exceptional forecasts were 440 - 455 million</p>
<p>stg	    versus 330 million stg last year.</p>
<p>*** Net profits including special items before dividend on</p>
<p>	    preference shares, special credit are expected to be</p>
<p>	    between 20 million stg and 25 million stg.</p>
<p>**** Net adjusted earnings. Figures in US dollars.</p>
<p>All profit figures are pretax, exclude exceptional items unless otherwise stated and are in millions stg. Dividends are total net and quoted as pence per share.</p>
<p>			     ----oOo----</p>
